line	<str>Descend the nearby ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go down the ladder directly east.</str>
line	
line	<str>Avoid touching mine carts.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south along the moving cart's tracks using the alcove for cover, then slightly west.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick a glowing fungus. Don't take any random events that teleport you out of the mine from now on or your fungus will turn to ash.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go NW and place the fungus in the searchable cart.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go NW to check the points settings. (Board on a wall)</str>
line	
line	<str>Write down which levers need to change to match the correct setting to get to the ladder in the top-right corner.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south-east and pull the needed levers (between A-E).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go north-west and pull the needed levers (between F-K).</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the point settings and click start.</str>
line	
line	<str>Leave the cave by going back the way you came</str>
line	
line	<str>Crawl-down the Cart tunnel to the north</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the nearby ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go NE and climb down the ladder by the door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go west then north and climb down the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the cart for the fungus and take it. Do not drop until you have completed the quest!</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up the ladder and start saving your run energy after you turn the water valve in the next step.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go all the way east then south past the moving cart.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head south and use the Zealot's key on the water valve.</str>
line	
line	<str>Quickly run to the lift and take it down.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south then East and down the stairs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick up the innocent-looking key to start the boss fight.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill Treus Dayth. It is recommended to pray Protect from Missiles throughout the fight. A good way to fight this boss is to run near him after attacking; the goal is to force him into the north-eastern corner. Once this occurs, run west to the end of the detached northern shaft and attack him from a distance. This prevents him from teleporting around the mine while also negating crane damage, which should make the fight easier.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick up the key</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back up the eastern stairs.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go west and down those stairs. You will need the <col=800000>Glowing fungus</col> to act as a light source.</col>
